            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Tide 1.2.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>New Shell Here: right-click a folder in the file explorer and choose New Shell Here to open a new tab in that folder. On a file it opens the file's folder, and on empty space it opens the project root.</li>
<li>Select several files at once in the file explorer: Cmd-click to add or remove one, Shift-click to select a range. The right-click menu then acts on the whole selection, including Move N Items to Trash, and Cmd-Backspace moves the selection to the Trash.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
