        <item>
            <title>1.0.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 21:04:13 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Tide 1.0.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Smoother tab dragging: the tab follows the pointer one to one and neighbouring tabs slide into place only when you pass their middle.</li>
<li>Fixed tabs swapping too early, tabs jumping vertically while dragged, and a tab staying visible after being dropped into a collapsed group.</li>
<li>Esc or releasing outside the window cancels a tab drag and returns the tab to its place.</li>
<li>Security hardening for dropped file names, git repositories you browse, and files opened externally.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
