        <item>
            <title>1.0.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:08:53 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Tide 1.0.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>First public release.</li>
<li>A native macOS terminal with command blocks: every command and its output is a block you can search, copy and collapse.</li>
<li>Split panes, tabs you can rename, reorder and group, and a command palette.</li>
<li>Tools panel with a file explorer, global search, a built-in editor and a git review pane.</li>
<li>Hover previews and Quick Look for files, images and links in the output.</li>
<li>Automatic updates with Sparkle (no data about your Mac is sent).</li>
</ul>
